{"id":"4f060a360dda4f05","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_LDivergesBetaEta.md","title":"LDivergesBetaEta","display":"LDivergesBetaEta","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"LDivergesBetaEta","parameters":["d","t"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"LDivergesBetaEta"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>d</span><span>t</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：指标替换与规约。有序参数：<code>d</code>、<code>t</code>。</p>\n<p>精确含义以本页公式体及其全部依赖为准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ LDivergesBetaEta d t)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(exists z1074\n  (exists z1075\n    (exists z1076\n      (and\n        (@ Omega z1075)\n        (and\n          (@ FunDom z1074 z1075)\n          (and\n            (@ Num0 z1076)\n            (and\n              (@ App z1074 z1076 t)\n              (forall z1077\n                (implies\n                  (in z1077 z1075)\n                  (exists z1078\n                    (exists z1079\n                      (exists z1080\n                        (and\n                          (@ Succ z1077 z1078)\n                          (and\n                            (@ App z1074 z1077 z1079)\n                            (and\n                            (@ URaw z1079)\n                            (and (@ Scoped d z1079) (and (@ App z1074 z1078 z1080) (@ LStepBetaEta z1079 z1080))))))))))))))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8bd25e131370b9c4\" href=\"?note=8bd25e131370b9c4\" title=\"ZFC_App\">App</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2fa14e4bd3447c97\" href=\"?note=2fa14e4bd3447c97\" title=\"ZFC_FunDom\">FunDom</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6f63f9693c73975a\" href=\"?note=6f63f9693c73975a\" title=\"ZFC_LStepBetaEta\">LStepBetaEta</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e8cec2782b4668b5\" href=\"?note=e8cec2782b4668b5\" title=\"ZFC_Num0\">Num0</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"3bcf6cd1d43a3007\" href=\"?note=3bcf6cd1d43a3007\" title=\"ZFC_Omega\">Omega</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"c005a1be0b2ad21f\" href=\"?note=c005a1be0b2ad21f\" title=\"ZFC_Scoped\">Scoped</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"1d9ce9ba5108a31b\" href=\"?note=1d9ce9ba5108a31b\" title=\"ZFC_Succ\">Succ</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"fad087c9d77463a6\" href=\"?note=fad087c9d77463a6\" title=\"ZFC_URaw\">URaw</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ LDivergesBetaEta d t)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_App","status":"resolved","id":"8bd25e131370b9c4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_FunDom|FunDom]]；[[ZFC_LStepBetaEta|LStepBetaEta]]；[[ZFC_Num0|Num0]]；[[ZFC_Omega|Omega]]；[[ZFC_Scoped|Scoped]]；[[ZFC_Succ|Succ]]；[[ZFC_URaw|URaw]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_FunDom","status":"resolved","id":"2fa14e4bd3447c97","anchor"